  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving the management and  operation system of the new Aqaba Marine Reserve</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to develop the marine reserve, by supporting the newly developed implementation plan. The project will develop the capacity of the reserve management team and engage the local community in preserving the reserve (including relevant local actors) and visitors with awareness and outreach activities.</narrative>
  </description>
